menu "Greenhouse block controller"

choice GREENHOUSE_DEVICE_MODE
    prompt "Device mode"
    default GREENHOUSE_DEVICE_MODE_PHYSICAL
    help
        Physical mode reads real sensors and drives real GPIO outputs.
        Simulated mode generates synthetic telemetry and does not require the
        sensor/actuator hardware to be connected.

    config GREENHOUSE_DEVICE_MODE_PHYSICAL
        bool "Physical hardware"

    config GREENHOUSE_DEVICE_MODE_SIMULATED
        bool "Simulated hardware"
endchoice

config GREENHOUSE_USB_BRIDGE
    bool "Enable USB serial bridge"
    default y
    help
        Enables a simple line protocol on the ESP32 USB serial console so the
        PC host runtime can read/write the same holding registers without the
        STM32 or an RS485 adapter.

endmenu
